claim:
RBI NBFC Responsible Business Conduct Third Amendment Directions 2026 (RBI/2026-27/230, dated 2026-08-06, effective 2027-01-01), read in primary on 2026-10-20 without CAPTCHA:
- contact only 08:00-19:00 unless the borrower asks;
- time and number of calls documented;
- calls recorded both ways, kept 6 months, borrower told;
- excessive calling and calling outside hours deemed harsh;
- every recovery communication carries the grievance officer's details;
- recovery agents need an IIBF certificate;
- NBFCs must also comply with TCCCPR (100AB).
Confirms REG-13 on the primary text.

